% professional advice. Its authors accept no liability for any loss or damage
% arising from its use.

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 14.

the actions are:
    the move drop with *a column* is made; known as drop.

the fluents are:
    *a column* cell *a height* with *a role*; known as cell.
    *a player* is a control; known as control.
    *a column* is the cellopen of *a height*; known as cellopen.
    *a player* is a line; known as line.
    *a thing* is columnempty; known as columnempty.
    *a thing* is a columnopen; known as columnopen.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.
    boardopen; known as boardopen.
    the move drop with *a column* is legal; known as legal_drop.

the templates are:
    the succ of *a thing* is *a second thing*.
    *a column* is a column.
    *a height* is a height.

the knowledge base badconnectfour includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/badconnectfour.hrf".

the succ of 1 is 2.

the succ of 2 is 3.

the succ of 3 is 4.

the succ of 4 is 5.

the succ of 5 is 6.

the succ of 6 is 7.

the succ of 7 is 8.

1 is a column.

2 is a column.

3 is a column.

4 is a column.

5 is a column.

6 is a column.

7 is a column.

8 is a column.

1 is a height.

2 is a height.

3 is a height.

4 is a height.

5 is a height.

6 is a height.

the move drop with a column is legal at a time if
    the column is a columnopen at the time.

the move drop with a column is legal at a time if
    a thing is a columnopen at the time
    and a second thing is a columnopen at the time
    and a third thing is a columnopen at the time
    and the column is a columnopen at the time
    and a fourth thing is a columnopen at the time
    and a fifth thing is a columnopen at the time.

the goal of red is 100 at a time if
    red is a line at the time.

the goal of red is 50 at a time if
    it is not the case that red is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that black is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that boardopen at the time.

the goal of red is 0 at a time if
    black is a line at the time.

the goal of red is 0 at a time if
    it is not the case that red is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that black is a line at the time
    and boardopen at the time.

the goal of black is 100 at a time if
    black is a line at the time.

the goal of black is 50 at a time if
    it is not the case that red is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that black is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that boardopen at the time.

the goal of black is 0 at a time if
    red is a line at the time.

the goal of black is 0 at a time if
    it is not the case that red is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that black is a line at the time
    and boardopen at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    red is a line at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    black is a line at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    it is not the case that boardopen at the time.

a column is the cellopen of a height at a time if
    the column is a column
    and the height is a height
    and it is not the case that the column cell the height with red at the time
    and it is not the case that the column cell the height with black at the time.

a thing is a columnopen at a time if
    the thing is the cellopen of 6 at the time.

a thing is columnempty at a time if
    the thing is the cellopen of 1 at the time.

boardopen at a time if
    a thing is a columnopen at the time.

a player is a line at a time if
    a column cell a height with the player at the time
    and the succ of the column is a thing
    and the succ of the thing is a second thing
    and the succ of the second thing is a third thing
    and the thing cell the height with the player at the time
    and the second thing cell the height with the player at the time
    and the third thing cell the height with the player at the time.

a player is a line at a time if
    a column cell a height with the player at the time
    and the succ of the height is a thing
    and the succ of the thing is a second thing
    and the succ of the second thing is a third thing
    and the column cell the thing with the player at the time
    and the column cell the second thing with the player at the time
    and the column cell the third thing with the player at the time.

a player is a line at a time if
    a column cell a height with the player at the time
    and the succ of the column is a thing
    and the succ of the thing is a second thing
    and the succ of the second thing is a third thing
    and the succ of the height is a fourth thing
    and the succ of the fourth thing is a fifth thing
    and the succ of the fifth thing is a sixth thing
    and the thing cell the fourth thing with the player at the time
    and the second thing cell the fifth thing with the player at the time
    and the third thing cell the sixth thing with the player at the time.

a player is a line at a time if
    a column cell a height with the player at the time
    and the succ of the column is a thing
    and the succ of the thing is a second thing
    and the succ of the second thing is a third thing
    and the succ of a fourth thing is the height
    and the succ of a fifth thing is the fourth thing
    and the succ of a sixth thing is the fifth thing
    and the thing cell the fourth thing with the player at the time
    and the second thing cell the fifth thing with the player at the time
    and the third thing cell the sixth thing with the player at the time.

when the move drop with a column is made
    and a role is a control
    and the column is columnempty
then the column cell 1 with the role.

when the move drop with a column is made
    and a role is a control
    and the column is the cellopen of a height
    and the succ of a thing is the height
    and it is not the case that the column is the cellopen of the thing
then the column cell the height with the role.

when the move drop with a column is made
    and red is a control
then black is a control
    and it is not the case that red is a control.

when the move drop with a column is made
    and black is a control
then red is a control
    and it is not the case that black is a control.

it must not be true that
    the move drop with a column is made
    and it is not the case that the move drop with the column is legal.

initially red is a control.

