%   - cell(7,1,red)
%   - cell(7,2,red)
%   - cell(8,1,black)
%   - cell(8,2,black)
scenario play is:
    the move drop with 1 is made from 1 to 2.
    the move drop with 8 is made from 2 to 3.
    the move drop with 7 is made from 3 to 4.
    the move drop with 6 is made from 4 to 5.
    the move drop with 5 is made from 5 to 6.
    the move drop with 4 is made from 6 to 7.
    the move drop with 3 is made from 7 to 8.
    the move drop with 2 is made from 8 to 9.
    the move drop with 1 is made from 9 to 10.
    the move drop with 8 is made from 10 to 11.
    the move drop with 7 is made from 11 to 12.
    the move drop with 6 is made from 12 to 13.

